{"term":"كس","lang":"ar","script":"arab","romanization":"kuss","category":"organs","subcategory":"vagina","concept":"vagina","is_novel_concept":false,"register":"slang_crude","crude":98,"technical":2,"recognition_pct_current":97,"recognition_pct_peak":97,"peak_year":null,"regional":null,"definition":"The most vulgar Arabic slang term for the vagina; the primary sexual expletive and taboo word for female genitalia across the Arab world.","english_term":"cunt","english_translation_quality":"direct","notes":"Arguably the single most offensive word in Arabic; cognate with similar roots across Semitic languages; functions simultaneously as expletive, insult, and sexual noun; recognized by virtually all adult Arabic speakers regardless of dialect."}
